ha-and-recursive-improvementƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;mNBXgWYGQfhHo-JCwF9t6iykk4soizHOJnqd59Q6UEYƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;of4TI5cdwDXfGBLA2lB8gSEZWtKtSoqTnDY2dB8-87oƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyEstablish an autonomous Alpaca customer circuit for Esther Davis that seeks evidence-backed alpha and recursively improves its strategies without Codex as runtime authority. The circuit must procure competing content-addressed market, issuer, account, and strategy-context products; require independent byte-bound context assays before inference; purchase inference and other compute through explicit Union market contracts and bounded compute-payment grants; bind every provider result to its context-product identity, model/provider, cost, and independent outcome assay; compare candidates using paper-account executions, reconciled venue evidence, risk, liquidity, execution quality, realized and counterfactual outcomes, and total cost per useful outcome; promote only witnessed improvements into reusable deterministic services and reopen residual demand. Alpaca paper Trading API credentials exist in the root environment but secret bytes must enter only a separately contracted, environment-bound, revocable custody provider. Live operation on Esther's real account remains a distinct gate requiring her exact durable grant, opaque credential admission, active revocation checks, capital/risk constraints, and independent reconciliation. Inventory and hire existing sovereign offers where compatible; emit explicit residual demand and refusals for missing suppliers rather than filling gaps with ambient Codex work.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;aPcVEMTcw5oJ5fz7in666meHA88RJCYV6CjjdNxTJ-kƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒeright